{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:0.1", "PA_ja_190:0.2", "PA_ja_190:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Peerless (Asadisavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:0.4", "PA_ja_190:1.1", "PA_ja_190:1.2"], "en": "10. The Birth Story of the Benefits of Virtue “Behold this fruit of faith, virtue, and generosity!”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:1.3"], "en": "As a dragon by its form carries a boat,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:1.4"], "en": "so let the lay follower carry faith;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:2.1"], "en": "one should associate only with the wise.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:2.2"], "en": "One should cultivate intimacy with the virtuous;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:2.3"], "en": "for by dwelling among the good,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:2.4"], "en": "even a barber attains safety.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:3.1"], "en": "The Sīlānisaṁsajātaka, the tenth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:3.2"], "en": "The fourth chapter, the Asadisa-vagga.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:4.1"], "en": "Its summary (uddāna):", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:5.1"], "en": "Dhanuggaha, Kuñjara, Apparasa,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:5.2", "PA_ja_190:5.3"], "en": "Giridatta, Anāvilacitta, Vara, Dadhivāhana, Jambuka, and Sīhanakha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_190:5.4"], "en": "\"By the excellent Nāga Haritayava, ten [times].\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
